   3.986851263906293*^9, 3.986851267886376*^9}},
 CellLabel->"In[19]:=",ExpressionUUID->"6f2c2599-a5e3-43e2-930c-b2c4dc76c793"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now we compare this with rate of mass transfer for a semidetached binary, \
where the mass transfer is driven by gravitational waves (Paczynski 1967). \
This is d",
 StyleBox["M",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "/d",
 StyleBox["t",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " in Eq. 3 in Nelemans+2001. \n\nThis is a product of d",
 StyleBox["J",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "/d",
 StyleBox["t",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " and the inverse of the dynamical stability criteria (Equation 4) which \
includes how the donor radius, Roche radius, and mass ratio change upon mass \
transfer. This is:"
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986523391820651*^9, 3.986523412629746*^9}, {
  3.9865235554368343`*^9, 3.9865235675523777`*^9}, {3.986526280021517*^9, 
  3.986526308042292*^9}, {3.986526758243773*^9, 3.986526768305293*^9}, {
  3.986526798475124*^9, 3.98652684583337*^9}, {3.986543803242774*^9, 
  3.986543810982793*^9}, {3.986852651442275*^9, 3.986852716252507*^9}, {
  3.9868527771443233`*^9, 3.986852809250155*^9}, {3.986852854016939*^9, 
  3.986852881114043*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"138ee796-62ca-49f3-8e67-\
e812e17dcc77"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Mdotacc", "[", 
   RowBox[{"m1_", ",", "m22_"}], "]"}], ":=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"JJ", "[", 
    RowBox[{"m1", ",", "m22", ",", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Rcold", "[", 
       RowBox[{"m22", "/", "Msol"}], "]"}], "Rsol"}]}], "]"}], "m22", " ", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "+", 
      FractionBox["\[Zeta]2cold", "2"], "-", 
      FractionBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Zeta]RLlist", "[", 
        RowBox[{"m1", ",", "m22"}], "]"}], "2"], "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"m22", "/", "m1"}]}], ")"}], 
    RowBox[{"-", "1"}]]}]}]], "Input",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986582969025723*^9, 3.9865829706062107`*^9}, 
   3.986583636482471*^9, {3.98668708502986*^9, 3.98668708516984*^9}, 
   3.986687314407673*^9, 3.986770498375757*^9},
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"a540ea18-d67d-4c8a-b7d2-20bb3c58362d"],

Cell["\<\
Note that this assumes that no angular momentum is lost in the system.

We equate this rate with the Eddington accretion rate\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.986526929794622*^9, 3.9865269482736177`*^9}, {
  3.986853181402684*^9, 
  3.98685319398142*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"993cbe64-aada-42d9-b8bc-\
c053a912a9df"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"bounda", "=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"m22", "/.", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"FindRoot", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Mdotacc", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Msol", " ", "m1"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Msol", " ", "m22"}]}], "]"}], "==", 
          RowBox[{"-", 
           RowBox[{"Medd22", "[", "m1", "]"}]}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"m22", ",", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"1", "/", "5"}], " ", "m1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"m1", ",", "0.0001", ",", "1.4", ",", "0.01"}], "}"}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "//", "Flatten"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
